        "longFormSummary": "<p>A forthcoming Shin-Okubo cafe with Monipa salad, homemade breakfast/lunch plates and a delivery-only salad coffret, with terrace seating and a planned central-tree dining room.<cite data-ref=\"https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000002.000191948.html\"></cite></p><p>The operator’s October 14, 2026 release explicitly announces public opening November 6, 2026. November 3–4 are completely invitation-only media/B2B preview sessions and are not public restaurant opening dates. The current operator company page still labels the cafe Coming soon.</p><p>Website lists 07:00–17:00 (last order 16:30), while the opening release says 08:00; confirm launch hours. All announced menu prices are unpublished. Planned room/frontage images are renderings. The salad coffret is advance-reservation delivery only.<cite data-ref=\"https://morningparkcafe.com/\"></cite></p>",
